  'SNYK-JS-UNDICI-19635218':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Improper Certificate Validation (BalancedPool drops function-valued tls/connect callbacks) in undici@7.29.0. Not runtime-reachable - undici@7.x is pulled only by cheerio@1.2.0, used in vitest tests and the build-time docusaurus toolchain of @defra/interactive-map; the grants-ui Hapi runtime uses the direct undici@8.10.0 copy and does not use BalancedPool. Fixed in undici 7.29.1 (published 2026-09-04), inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown until 2026-09-11. Then bump cheerio or add an undici@7 override and remove this ignore.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
  'SNYK-JS-UNDICI-19635224':
    - '*':
        reason: 'Origin Validation Error in undici@8.10.0 (cache/deduplicate interceptor keys omit the destination origin). grants-ui uses undici only as ProxyAgent + setGlobalDispatcher in src/server/common/helpers/proxy/setup-proxy.js and never calls interceptors.cache()/interceptors.deduplicate(), so it is not exploitable here. Fixed in undici 8.10.2 (published 2026-09-04), inside the .npmrc min-release-age=7 cooldown until 2026-09-11 (npm install fails with ETARGET before then). Then bump dependencies.undici + overrides.undici to 8.10.2 and remove this ignore.'
        expires: '2026-09-24'
